    "b16.f10": "Mouse B16-F10 reads and VCFs driving the CLI/report smoke (run-vaxrank-b16-test-data.sh) and the mutant-protein-sequence tests. Osteosarc publishes the human Sid dataset only, so these stay in-repo; they are pinned by digest here because nothing else verifies them.",
